christmas has come and gone  unfortunately the presents are all open  now it's time for the cleanup the  alcoholman shares how to properly  dispose of all the paper  boxes and the tree tis the season to  recycle your christmas tree  before you do there's some things to  remember before dropping off your tree  remove all the lights  wire tinsel ornaments and nails the  trees are turned into mulch which is  used at city parks  so any foreign objects can contaminate  the mulch and ruin the chipper flock  trees the ones with artificial snow  cannot be recycled  last year nearly 17 thousand trees were  recycled and when it comes to tossing  out gift boxes and festive paper  not everything is on the nice list a  paper fiber can be recycled seven to 12  times the reds and the greens are not  very recyclable friendly  so when we say those type of wrapping  papers when in doubt throw it out  recycling managers say the red and  greens cannot be dyed  so it's a problem when companies want to  turn it into a new paper product some  other things on the naughty list are  tissue paper  gift tags and tree lights reporting  bianca holman  8 news now
 

